{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 37,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        53.92401885986328,
        359.54022216796875,
        70.70701599121094
      ],
      "text": "5.4\t Weekly rifapentine plus isoniazid for 3 months",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        76.64232635498047,
        526.6761474609375,
        89.44232940673828
      ],
      "text": "A new systematic review was conducted to compare the effectiveness of a 3-month weekly regimen of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        90.64232635498047,
        526.6610717773438,
        103.44232940673828
      ],
      "text": "rifapentine plus isoniazid with that of isoniazid monotherapy. The review covered four RCTs  , which  (52–55)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        104.64232635498047,
        526.6461791992188,
        117.44232940673828
      ],
      "text": "were analysed for three subgroups: adults with HIV infection, adults without HIV infection and children and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        118.64232635498047,
        526.701171875,
        131.44232177734375
      ],
      "text": "adolescents, who could not be stratified according to HIV status because the relevant studies were lacking.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        344.2181396484375,
        132.58233642578125,
        413.869140625,
        145.5123291015625
      ],
      "text": "Annexes 1 and 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        132.642333984375,
        418.7261047363281,
        145.44232177734375
      ],
      "text": "The evidence-to-decision and the GRADE tables are presented in  .",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        152.31231689453125,
        526.6311645507812,
        165.1123046875
      ],
      "text": "Two of the RCTs involved adults with HIV from South Africa, Peru and in a number of countries with a low",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        166.31231689453125,
        526.604248046875,
        179.1123046875
      ],
      "text": "incidence of TB. No significant difference was found in the incidence of active TB between participants given",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        180.31231689453125,
        526.7003173828125,
        193.1123046875
      ],
      "text": "a 3-month weekly regimen of rifapentine plus isoniazid and 6 or 9 months of isoniazid monotherapy (RR 0.73,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        194.31231689453125,
        526.7080688476562,
        207.1123046875
      ],
      "text": "95% CI 0.23;2.30). Furthermore, the risk for hepatotoxicity was significantly lower with the 3-month weekly",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        208.31231689453125,
        526.6910400390625,
        221.1123046875
      ],
      "text": "regimen of rifapentine plus isoniazid in adults with HIV (RR 0.26, 95% CI 0.12;0.55) and those without HIV",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        222.31231689453125,
        526.728515625,
        235.1123046875
      ],
      "text": "(RR 0.16, 95% CI 0.10;0.27). The weekly regimen was also associated with a higher completion rate in all",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        236.31231689453125,
        526.6830444335938,
        249.1123046875
      ],
      "text": "subgroups (adults with HIV: RR 1.25, 95% CI 1.01;1.55; adults without HIV: RR 1.19, 95% CI 1.16;1.22, children",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        250.31231689453125,
        526.71142578125,
        263.1123046875
      ],
      "text": "and adolescents: RR 1.09, 95% CI 1.03;1.15). One RCT included a comparison between a 3-month weekly",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        264.31231689453125,
        526.6660766601562,
        277.1123046875
      ],
      "text": "regimen of rifapentine plus isoniazid and continuous isoniazid monotherapy in adults with HIV infection  .  (52)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        278.31231689453125,
        526.6324462890625,
        291.1123046875
      ],
      "text": "No significant difference in TB incidence was found in an intention-to-treat analysis; however, a per-protocol",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        292.31231689453125,
        526.6831665039062,
        305.1123046875
      ],
      "text": "analysis showed a lower rate of TB infection or death in participants given continuous isoniazid. In all the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        306.31231689453125,
        494.4042053222656,
        319.1123046875
      ],
      "text": "studies, the 3-month regimen of weekly rifapentine plus isoniazid was given under direct observation.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        325.9823303222656,
        526.6670532226562,
        338.7823181152344
      ],
      "text": "In a study of the 3-month weekly regimen of rifapentine plus isoniazid in 112 pregnant women, the rates of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        339.9823303222656,
        466.256103515625,
        352.7823181152344
      ],
      "text": "spontaneous abortion and birth defects were similar to those in the general US population  . (56)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        372.59234619140625,
        362.9120178222656,
        385.5223388671875
      ],
      "text": "Table 2\t Recommended dosages of drugs for the treatment of LTBI",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        636.0388793945312,
        237.75367736816406,
        651.5428466796875
      ],
      "text": "Rationale for the recommendations",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.8615112304688,
        526.6563110351562,
        667.6614990234375
      ],
      "text": "The selection of treatment options by programmes and clinicians should consider the characteristics of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        668.8615112304688,
        526.6361083984375,
        681.6614990234375
      ],
      "text": "the clients who are to receive treatment to ensure that it is not only initiated but also completed. The GDG",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        682.8615112304688,
        526.7212524414062,
        695.6614990234375
      ],
      "text": "agreed that the benefits of all the treatment options outweigh the potential harm. They also noted that all the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        696.8615112304688,
        526.6382446289062,
        709.6614990234375
      ],
      "text": "treatment options can be self-administered. An RCT showed that self-administered treatment of the 3-month",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        710.8615112304688,
        526.6549682617188,
        723.6614990234375
      ],
      "text": "regimen of weekly rifapentine plus isoniazid is not inferior to directly observed treatment  ; however,  (57)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        724.8615112304688,
        526.6612548828125,
        737.6614990234375
      ],
      "text": "there is little further evidence on self-administration of this regimen. The GDG noted that a requirement",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        738.8615112304688,
        526.71728515625,
        751.6614990234375
      ],
      "text": "for a direct observation could be a significant barrier to the implementation. The GDG further noted that",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        752.8615112304688,
        526.6353149414062,
        765.6614990234375
      ],
      "text": "individuals receiving treatment, clinicians providing treatment and programme managers prefer shorter to",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        766.8615112304688,
        142.80311584472656,
        779.6614990234375
      ],
      "text": "longer regimens.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        538.5827026367188,
        790.2608032226562,
        555.78271484375,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "25",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        312.9197082519531,
        796.524658203125,
        524.4070434570312,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "5. TREATMENT OPTIONS FOR LATENT TUBERCULOSIS INFECTION",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}